---
import Page from "@layouts/Page.astro";
import Section from "@components/Section.astro";
import SectionHead from "@components/SectionHead.astro";
import SectionSub from "@components/SectionSub.astro";
import SectionSub2Col from "@components/SectionSub2Col.astro";
import Details from "@components/Details.astro";
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";
const title = "DeveloperTown Values";
import Hero from "@images/work/dtv/dt-hero-dot.jpg";
import Home from "@images/work/dtv/home.jpg";
import HomeMobile from "@images/work/dtv/home-mobile.jpg";
import Ownership from "@images/work/dtv/takeownership.jpg";
import OwnershipMobile from "@images/work/dtv/takeownership-mobile.jpg";
---

<Page title={title} hero={Hero}>
  <Section>
    <SectionHead title="Summary" />
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto typography gap-4 flex flex-col">
      <p class="text-pretty">
        <a href="https://developertown.com/" target="_blank">DeveloperTown</a> wanted a focused, intentional way to communicate its values—separate from marketing content and without unnecessary technical or visual complexity.
      </p>
      <p class="text-pretty">Working with content developed during a company-wide values workshop and in collaboration with internal stakeholders, I translated those principles into a lightweight, accessible microsite. The emphasis was on clarity, performance, and long-term maintainability rather than visual polish or over-engineering.</p>
      <dl class="flex flex-row flex-nowrap gap-2">
        <dt class="text-indigo-900">Website:</dt>
        <dd>
          <a href="https://values.developertown.com/" target="_blank"> values.developertown.com </a>
        </dd>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </Section>
  <Section>
    <SectionHead title="Role & Scope" />
    <SectionSub>
      <Details>
        <h3 slot="summaryTitle" class="mb-0">My Role</h3>
        <p>Front-end implementation and technical decision-making. I partnered with internal stakeholders to structure content, select an appropriate platform, and build a fast, accessible site that supported the message without distraction.</p>
      </Details>
      <Details>
        <h3 slot="summaryTitle" class="mb-0">Primary Goals</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6">
          <li>Clearly communicate company values in a dedicated space</li>
          <li>Prioritize performance, accessibility, and simplicity</li>
          <li>Minimize long-term maintenance and technical overhead</li>
        </ul>
      </Details>
    </SectionSub>
  </Section>
  <Section>
    <SectionHead title="Approach" />
    <SectionSub>
      <Details>
        <h3 slot="summaryTitle" class="mb-0">Content-First Structure</h3>
        <p>I worked with stakeholders to organize the values content into a clear hierarchy, ensuring each section was readable, focused, and supported by consistent page patterns.</p>
      </Details>
      <Details>
        <h3 slot="summaryTitle" class="mb-0">Technical Strategy</h3>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-10">
          <SectionSub2Col>
            <h4 slot="title">Astro</h4>
            <p>
              I built the site using <a href="https://astro.build/" target="_blank">Astro</a> to prioritize performance, simplicity, and long-term maintainability. Static generation allowed the content to remain fast, secure, and easy to evolve without ongoing platform complexity.
            </p>
          </SectionSub2Col>
          <SectionSub2Col>
            <h4 slot="title">Tailwind CSS</h4>
            <p>
              <a href="https://tailwindcss.com/" target="_blank">Tailwind CSS</a> was used to rapidly implement consistent layouts while keeping the final CSS output minimal. Its utility-first approach supported responsive layouts without introducing custom CSS overhead.
            </p>
          </SectionSub2Col>
        </div>
      </Details>
      <Details>
        <h3 slot="summaryTitle" class="mb-0">Accessibility & Usability</h3>
        <p>Semantic HTML, readable typography, and predictable navigation patterns were prioritized to ensure the content was accessible and easy to consume across devices and assistive technologies.</p>
      </Details>
    </SectionSub>
  </Section>
  <Section>
    <SectionHead title="Results" />
    <SectionSub>
      <p class="max-w-2xl typography">The final site delivered a clean, purpose-driven experience that allowed DeveloperTown’s values to stand on their own—without visual noise or technical bloat.</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 max-w-2xl typography">
        <li>Fast-loading, lightweight static site</li>
        <li>Clear content structure aligned with company culture</li>
        <li>Low-maintenance foundation that can evolve over time</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:flex-nowrap gap-8 mt-10">
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div>
            <h3>Desktop</h3>
            <Image src={Home} alt="" class="lg:max-h-[860px] w-auto outline outline-indigo-100" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3>Mobile</h3>
            <Image src={HomeMobile} alt="" class="lg:max-h-[860px] w-auto outline outline-indigo-100" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div>
            <h3>Desktop</h3>
            <Image src={Ownership} alt="" class="lg:max-h-[860px] w-auto outline outline-indigo-100" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3>Mobile</h3>
            <Image src={OwnershipMobile} alt="" class="lg:max-h-[860px] w-auto outline outline-indigo-100" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </SectionSub>
  </Section>
</Page>
